python-vaporetto
----------------
https://github.com/daac-tools/python-vaporetto

    Copyright (c) 2022-2026 Koichi Akabe <vbkaisetsu@gmail.com> and the
    python-vaporetto contributors

    Licensed under either of Apache License, Version 2.0, or MIT license,
    at your option.

Consulted as a reference implementation. The strategy of predicting on the
normalized text and transferring only the resulting boundaries and tags back to
a second `Sentence` built from the original text is adapted from its
`src/lib.rs`.


sqlite-vaporetto
----------------
https://github.com/hotchpotch/sqlite-vaporetto

    Licensed under either of Apache License, Version 2.0, or MIT license,
    at your option.

Consulted as a reference implementation for calling Vaporetto 0.6.5. The
mapping from `wsconst` characters (D/R/H/T/K/O/G) to `vaporetto_rules` sentence
filters, and the overall shape of the offset-reconstruction loop, are adapted
from its `src/lib.rs`. Attribution is repeated inline at each adapted function.


